            accent: widget.accent,
          ),
          const SizedBox(height: 8),
          Align(
            alignment: Alignment.centerRight,
            child: CupertinoButton(
              padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
              onPressed: _showForgotPassword,
              child: Text(
                t('forgot_password'),
                style: TextStyle(
                  fontSize: 14,
                  color: widget.accent,
                  fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                ),
              ),
            ),
          ),
          const SizedBox(height: 20),
          _BigButton(
            label: t('btn_login'),
